{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"I come into hampstead, having my first good look around the place.\n\n\"Better than Kingsbridge.\" I say, shrugging. I begin to stroll the streets, looking for a public house, or simply something to catch my interest.","created_at":"2021-07-12T01:31:42.271000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863955749788188684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"An older man, hunched in his gait with a noticible limp, aided by a scepter, emerges from the winding alleyways. The only thing distracting from his deep crimson skin and long black horns is his outfit. A gaudy black and red Arabian cloak with a silver trim, somewhat similar to that of an affluent sultan. \nBeneath his hood, bright yellow slanted eyes and a forked tongue appear visible. He mutters to himself as he walks by.","created_at":"2021-07-12T01:32:29.531000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863955948011782185","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Pardon me sir! I wonder if you would like to retain the services of an inventor?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T01:33:16.758000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863956146095521842","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
