{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"I hurry towards the sultan, my voice nervous but determined.","created_at":"2021-07-12T01:33:36.989000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863956230950223872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"The man pauses, and turns around, regarding the two of you. \"Why... Hello. It is lovely night for a stroll, is it not gentlemen?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T01:35:21.958000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T01:36:43.084000Z","id":"863956671221989396","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Why yes it is... Might I trouble you, or any others, with a small favor?\" He motions towards any and all around him.","created_at":"2021-07-12T01:36:39.977000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863956998457917460","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Hmm, I am in the business of granting *favors...* for a price. what is it you need my friend?\" The older man asks as he leans towards you.","created_at":"2021-07-12T01:37:53.819000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863957308173975554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Quite, sir! Quite indeed! Lovely! Favors, you say! I am in . . . need of a favor, kind sir! Financial favors, specifically!\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T01:38:47.938000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863957535164596236","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"\"Them dern coats pegged me last night, locked me up in tha slammer for bein out too late. I was released this mornin'.\" Bo hold up his arms shaking the shackels. \"But they left these infernal things on me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T01:39:37.282000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863957742128594954","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
